DESCRIPTION:This is a free program in the Windows on the World classroom\, located on the 3rd floor of the Nature Exploration Center in downtown Raleigh. Story Time is designed especially for children 5 and younger and books are chosen with this age group in mind. Join us in the summer on Wednesdays at 10:30am and on Fridays at 10:30am & 11:30am. \nPlease note that we do not guarantee the opportunity to touch live animals during this program. \nFor more information\, contact Emma Feichter at emma.feichter@naturalsciences.org or 919.707.9956.
