SUMMARY:Frog Calls
DESCRIPTION:Frogs and toads make a wide variety of calls to communicate and we can use their calls to identify the species we hear.  Join ecoEXPLORE Central NC to learn about frog calls\, the many different types of calls frogs make\, and practice making the calls yourself in this interctive virtual program! \nThis program is for kids ages 5-13 in the ecoEXPLORE program\, but all are welcome! You will learn about ecoEXPLORE during the program. \nRegister
URL:https://www.naturalsciences.org/calendar/event/frog-calls/
LOCATION:Virtual\, NC\, United States
CATEGORIES:Children,Citizen Science,ecoEXPLORE,K-12 Students,Teens,Virtual
ORGANIZER;CN="ecoEXPLORE%20Team":MAILTO:ecoexplore@naturalsciences.org
END:VEVENT
