SUMMARY:Nature Storytime (Whiteville)
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a family-friendly natural science story and fun activities. Books are chosen for ages 4–7\, but families with children of all ages are welcome. No registration required. \nFor the summer months (June\, July and August)\, this program is offered weekly on Thursdays and Saturdays from 10:30–11am. \nNote: Each week will feature the same story on Thursday and Saturday. \nFor more information\, please call the Museum at Whiteville: 910.788.5100.
